WEBVTT

NOTE Timings aligned locally from the source audio.

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:13.780
(monkey screeches) M. m. Mmm, Mmm, Mmm.

2
00:00:13.780 --> 00:00:22.150
Mmm, Moon. Oh, moon. Where are you? Mmm.

3
00:00:22.150 --> 00:00:53.310
Mmm, Motorcycle. (motorcycle engines roaring) Mmm.

4
00:00:53.310 --> 00:00:59.280
Mmm, Mask. Mmm, Masks. Oink, oink! Oink, oink! Mmm.

5
00:00:59.280 --> 00:01:04.150
Make a match. (popping)

6
00:01:04.150 --> 00:01:54.830
F, J. Y, M. Y, y. Yuh. R, F. F, f. Fff. J, j. Juh. W, w. Wuh. M, m. Mmm. R, r. Rrr.

7
00:01:54.830 --> 00:02:02.650
How many monkeys? (twinkling music) (laughing)

8
00:02:02.650 --> 00:02:10.090
Mmm. Goodbye.

9
00:02:10.090 --> 00:02:11.211
THE END
